The Mercedes-Benz S65 AMG (W222 generation, produced from 2014 to 2019) was the top-of-the-line, V12-powered high-performance variant of the S-Class sedan. It was exclusively available in long-wheelbase and rear-wheel-drive configurations.

Here is the evaluation based on the provided scoring guide and search results:

*   **price\_usd**: -1.00 - The S65 AMG had a base price well over $200,000 (Source: [2]), placing it firmly in the highest price bracket.
*   **total\_cost\_estimate\_5yr\_usd**: -1.00 - With a very high purchase price, significant depreciation, high insurance costs, and expensive maintenance, the 5-year ownership cost is well above the $60,000 threshold.
*   **insurance\_usd\_yr**: -1.00 - As a high-value, high-performance luxury vehicle, the S65 AMG falls into the highest insurance cost categories (Source: [4]).
