*   **torque**: 1.00 - The engine delivers a massive 738 lb-ft (1000 Nm) of torque (Source: [1, 2, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 15, 17, 30]), well exceeding the average (190 lb-ft) and closer to the superb benchmark (>1000 lb-ft). 1.00 is warranted.
