*   **transmission\_type**: 1.00 - It uses a 7-speed AMG SPEEDSHIFT PLUS automatic transmission (Source: [1, 2, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12, 15, 16, 19, 20, 27, 30]), scoring +1.00 for automatic transmission.
